      "title": "Second quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.97 (vs ₹2.89 in 2Q 2025)",
      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.97 (up from ₹2.89 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹300.7m (up 39% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹44.6m (up 2.9% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (down from 20% in 2Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 40% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 2% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
